      <activity id="a39c8824-33fe-50b2-9b0a-a0595e0f7197" activityNameId="a80d5aa5-91f9-574f-a2b0-dcc36e3a481d" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xxx Sawn timber, hardwood, planed, air / kiln dried, u=10%, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xxx Sawn timber, hardwood, planed, air / kiln dried, u=10%, at plant
The multi-output process "planing, hardwood, air / kiln dried, u=10%" delivers the two coproducts "sawn timber, hardwood, planed, air / kiln dried, u=10%, at plant" and "industrial residue wood, from planing, hard, air/kiln dried, u=10%, at plant". Allocation is based on the over-all proceeds of the process.;
UUID: 65df62e3-c071-3971-b9fd-2011f668069c
Includes planing process. planing mill is assumed to be located on the sawmill site. No transports are considered. Dust emissions are neglected for a lack of data.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Technology mix used in Germany (1986)
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: see Geography and Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: The assumption that the German technology mix is representative for central Europe is considered in the uncertainties.
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_65df62e3-c071-3971-b9fd-2011f668069c.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
